  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OUTDOOR GYM AT AL HUSSEIN YOUTH CITY - AMMAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project was to support the creation of a well-equipped and accessible outdoor gym at the Al Hussein Youth City. The Government of Jordan has sought to prioritise the mental and physicial wellbeing of its citizens, which includes an active and healthy lifestyle, and the project sought to promote equal access to facilities and accessible outdoor spaces. The outdoor gym will contribute towards the health, recreational and social needs of the local community around the Youth City, and encourage citizens to become more active.</narrative>
  </description>
